# Hooks Directory

This directory contains custom React hooks for the LNK File Management Center.

## Planned Hooks

- `useLnkFiles` - Manage LNK file state and operations
- `useTheme` - Theme management (light/dark mode)
- `useBatchJob` - Batch operation management
- `useSettings` - Application settings management
- `useDragDrop` - Drag and drop functionality
- `useKeyboardShortcuts` - Keyboard shortcut handling